# Netlify: enable `crossOriginIsolated` so the browser exposes
# `SharedArrayBuffer` — needed by the multi-threaded solver to broadcast
# its "first worker found a solution, everyone bail" stop flag.
#
# `credentialless` (rather than `require-corp`) means cross-origin resources
# without explicit CORP/CORS headers still load, just without credentials.
# That's important for the Neopets figure GIFs (https://images.neopets.com/…)
# we show in the result UI — they're public images so loading them
# anonymously is fine.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
